"200\">OTECH 1.25G BiDi SFP Module TX1310nm/RX1550nm LC Single-Mode 20KM</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"673\" class=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"237\">OTECH 1.25G BiDi SFP Module</strong> offers high-speed and reliable data transmission over single-mode fiber using a <strong data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"342\">bidirectional (BiDi)</strong> optical design. With a <strong data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"393\">TX wavelength of 1310nm</strong> and <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"414\">RX at 1550nm</strong>, this module transmits data efficiently through a single fiber strand. Featuring an <strong data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"515\">LC connector</strong> and supporting distances up to <strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"555\">20KM</strong>, it is ideal for enterprise networks, ISPs, and data centers requiring compact and cost-effective fiber connectivity.</p>\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"692\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"692\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"954\"><li data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"731\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"731\" class=\"\">Data Rate: 1.25Gbps Gigabit Ethernet</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"767\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"767\" class=\"\">Wavelength: TX 1310nm / RX 1550nm</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"809\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"809\" class=\"\">Connector Type: LC, BiDi (Single Fiber)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"841\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"841\" class=\"\">Fiber Type: Single-Mode (SMF)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"877\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"877\" class=\"\">Transmission Distance: Up to 20KM</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"909\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"909\" class=\"\">Hot-pluggable SFP form factor</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"954\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"954\" class=\"\">Low power consumption and high reliability</p></li><li>Made in China</li><li>1-Year (Replacement Warranty)</li></ul>\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1131\" class=\"\">Ensure seamless long-range fiber communication with the <strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1046\">OTECH 1.25G BiDi LC SFP Module</strong>, compatible with a wide range of switches and routers that support SFP transceivers.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","now":"2,500৳","old":"3,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba 40G QSFP+ LC BiDi 150m MMF SFP Module","href":"/hpe-aruba-40g-qsfp-lc-bidi-150m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"7,000৳","old":"8,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco 40GBASE QSFP-40G-LR4-S 1310nm Single-Mode Duplex SMF LC 10KM SFP Module","href":"/cisco-40gbase-qsfp-40g-lr4-s-1310nm-single-mode-duplex-smf-lc-10km-sfp-module","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SX 1000BASE-SX 850nm 550m MMF SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sx-1000base-sx-850nm-550m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"3,000৳","old":"3,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Finisar 1000 BASE-T Copper RJ45 SFP Module 100m","href":"/finisar-1000-base-t-copper-rj45-sfp-module-100m","now":"1,100৳","old":"1,200৳","